error BYN2236: a map literal needs `key: value` in every element

  1 │ Map<string, i32> stock = ["A-1": 12, 3];
    │                                      ^ no `key:` here
    │
  help: write every element as `key: value`, or remove the keys to make a list

error BYN2236: a map literal needs `key: value` in every element

  2 │ let headers = ["Accept", "Host": "x"];
    │                ^^^^^^^^ no `key:` here
    │
  help: write every element as `key: value`, or remove the keys to make a list
